      "content": "hey, i'm looking over the Q3 resource projections for the iceland facilities. the board is pushing hard for some budget cuts to the cloud compute budget to offset the recent energy spikes. i'm thinking we might need to transition the absorption parameters to a static, pre-programmed schedule for the next few months instead of running the live optimization layer. lets see how that affects the projected capture rates for the next quarter.",
